                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8401330b-4d88-3c43-ab29-3db61806f92c",
                        "entry_id": "56dd4933-a89d-35eb-84d5-d73eb8d8d293",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bedrog waarbij men iemand geld of goed afhandig weet te maken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bde7398-c635-4142-8e9f-7223cbcc8c8b",
                                "sense_id": "8401330b-4d88-3c43-ab29-3db61806f92c",
                                "text": "Hij was betrokken in vele zaken met betrekking tot oplichting, dus dat is niet iemand waar je zaken mee wilt doen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c874b43c-b11e-4003-adaa-80f3709531c1",
                                "sense_id": "8401330b-4d88-3c43-ab29-3db61806f92c",
                                "text": "“We menen dat Milei deel uitmaakt van een organisatie die oplichting organiseert op historisch grote schaal.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "35acd452-7158-47a9-b553-e237e818f0a2",
                        "source_entry_id": "56dd4933-a89d-35eb-84d5-d73eb8d8d293",
                        "source_sense_id": "8401330b-4d88-3c43-ab29-3db61806f92c",
                        "source_sense_description": "bedrog waarbij men iemand geld of goed afhandig weet te maken",
                        "target_lang_word": "Betrug",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Betrug",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81352d38-0e1c-3a4c-bc2d-d40b5bd0864d",
                                        "entry_id": "3dbab1d0-60d8-3bce-99e1-326d4cff70d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "vorsätzliche Täuschung und Irreführung einer anderen Person; Täuschungshandlung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c11ac65-be42-4be5-860e-57eb6b9a4a31",
                                                "sense_id": "81352d38-0e1c-3a4c-bc2d-d40b5bd0864d",
                                                "text": "Der Betrug ist offensichtlich."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81236fd4-11b1-43f7-8748-0cf90be81984",
                                                "sense_id": "81352d38-0e1c-3a4c-bc2d-d40b5bd0864d",
                                                "text": "Er ist nur auf Betrug aus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ad38858-2716-46d7-8b33-cfef316e651c",
                                                "sense_id": "81352d38-0e1c-3a4c-bc2d-d40b5bd0864d",
                                                "text": "„Mary würde einen anderen Weg finden müssen, um den von ihm begangenen Betrug zu verbergen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "665cdf9c-be3b-40d0-a836-cb4cc79c5806",
                                                "sense_id": "81352d38-0e1c-3a4c-bc2d-d40b5bd0864d",
                                                "text": "„Trotz allem Esprit der Franzosen ist und bleibt Paris immer die Stadt, wo sich Betrug lohnt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a869aef2-0f65-490c-b174-1a3ad7e9ca27",
                                                "sense_id": "81352d38-0e1c-3a4c-bc2d-d40b5bd0864d",
                                                "text": "„Zur Verhandlung kommt der zweite Betrug.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ae550a8c-218d-42f8-96cd-62163f4776d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "56dd4933-a89d-35eb-84d5-d73eb8d8d293",
                        "source_sense_id": "8401330b-4d88-3c43-ab29-3db61806f92c",
                        "source_sense_description": "bedrog waarbij men iemand geld of goed afhandig weet te maken",
                        "target_lang_word": "Schwindel",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Schwindel",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a7c9552-e81f-36aa-ae38-013fb64ed8a3",
                                        "entry_id": "865ef420-4556-3cb0-b619-24d71527cd05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beeinträchtigung des Gleichgewichtssinns; Gefühl zu taumeln, wanken"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "767a31c5-b4e3-43ff-95ee-4ec80fc965ee",
                                                "sense_id": "3a7c9552-e81f-36aa-ae38-013fb64ed8a3",
                                                "text": "Mich überkam plötzlich ein heftiger Schwindel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8da3155c-8469-4ae8-a932-00afce640590",
                                                "sense_id": "3a7c9552-e81f-36aa-ae38-013fb64ed8a3",
                                                "text": "„Er versuchte aufzustehen, aber Schwindel und Schüttelfrost vereitelten seinen Plan.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d6b2d02-17ba-4402-aae1-4057126befe7",
                                                "sense_id": "3a7c9552-e81f-36aa-ae38-013fb64ed8a3",
                                                "text": "Der 65-jährige Finanzminister Rapanos klagte über Schwindel und Schweißausbrüche und wurde wegen eines Ohnmachtsanfalls zur Beobachtung in eine Privatklinik eingewiesen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7034c1b-0dfc-49fe-8db5-f5ddeadad0aa",
                                                "sense_id": "3a7c9552-e81f-36aa-ae38-013fb64ed8a3",
                                                "text": "Anna S. ist niedergeschlagen, antriebslos. Sie hat Schlafstörungen, leidet unter Schwindel und Kopfschmerzen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1924b17-6b01-4809-8a62-64ceadb409b0",
                                                "sense_id": "3a7c9552-e81f-36aa-ae38-013fb64ed8a3",
                                                "text": "Alles dreht sich, der Boden schwankt: Schwindel! Jeder kennt es vom Karussellfahren. Doch da geht das Gefühl zum Glück schnell vorüber. Aber was tun, wenn der Schwindel zur Qual wird?"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e122b47a-b88b-324c-a5dd-bf65bdeb7794",
                                        "entry_id": "865ef420-4556-3cb0-b619-24d71527cd05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(nicht sehr schwerwiegende) unwahre Aussage"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f0ba11d-82d1-4a93-a0d6-006644b030fd",
                                                "sense_id": "e122b47a-b88b-324c-a5dd-bf65bdeb7794",
                                                "text": "Alles, was die machen, ist ein einziger Schwindel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a17aa7f-f143-400c-b9b9-6b15d2d1347f",
                                                "sense_id": "e122b47a-b88b-324c-a5dd-bf65bdeb7794",
                                                "text": "Da er [Professor Harald Lesch] auch Schwindel und Irrtümer in den Naturwissenschaften aufklärt, hat er sich nicht nur Freunde gemacht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04247d3a-c785-45ca-8bbd-f964542f9b8e",
                                                "sense_id": "e122b47a-b88b-324c-a5dd-bf65bdeb7794",
                                                "text": "„Wenn entwickelte Länder sich darauf zurückziehen, dass Klimawandel ein Schwindel sei und sie keine Pflicht hätten, die Klimaziele zu erfüllen, dann ist das eine sehr ignorante Position.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "769d1b22-3c90-4f79-bb19-788cd03a311c",
                                                "sense_id": "e122b47a-b88b-324c-a5dd-bf65bdeb7794",
                                                "text": "Zu Fake News sagte man früher Schwindel"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1307c6d-0cd7-4957-9c13-7d8dbfe756c7",
                                                "sense_id": "e122b47a-b88b-324c-a5dd-bf65bdeb7794",
                                                "text": "„Es gibt kein Verbrechen, keinen Kniff, keinen Trick, keinen Schwindel, kein Laster, das nicht von Geheimhaltung lebt. Bringt diese Heimlichkeiten ans Tageslicht, beschreibt sie, macht sie vor aller Augen lächerlich.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ed78b31a-519e-475f-a9f1-2c23045f84d0",
                        "source_entry_id": "56dd4933-a89d-35eb-84d5-d73eb8d8d293",
                        "source_sense_id": "8401330b-4d88-3c43-ab29-3db61806f92c",
                        "source_sense_description": "bedrog waarbij men iemand geld of goed afhandig weet te maken",
                        "target_lang_word": "swindle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "swindle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4d75f3c-b12d-36ba-b9e7-06afbfbeeed0",
                                        "entry_id": "972d5291-c0fe-396c-b346-cfdffff50095",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To defraud."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a8b5809-96c9-4723-a20d-17bee584f1e4",
                                                "sense_id": "a4d75f3c-b12d-36ba-b9e7-06afbfbeeed0",
                                                "text": "The two men swindled the company out of $160,000."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aaa16aa1-bf81-44b9-95f3-21ac72751fed",
                                                "sense_id": "a4d75f3c-b12d-36ba-b9e7-06afbfbeeed0",
                                                "text": "Such Nations cannot have a King to command them; can only have this or the other scandalous swindling Copper Captain, constitutional Gilt Mountebank, or other the like unsalutary entity by way of King; and the sins of the fathers are visited upon the children in a frightful and tragical manner, little noticed in the Penny Newspapers and Periodical Literatures of this generation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "827baccc-485b-4f16-a5fd-1a6696523f55",
                                                "sense_id": "a4d75f3c-b12d-36ba-b9e7-06afbfbeeed0",
                                                "text": "That word is bezzle. It describes the period in which an embezzler has stolen a man's money but the victim does not yet realize he's been swindled."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a1b0f5f-eb51-3d35-abee-30d02a08a77f",
                                        "entry_id": "972d5291-c0fe-396c-b346-cfdffff50095",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To obtain (money or property) by fraudulent or deceitful methods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90bccae6-2e83-4923-9bc2-f0e70469fdec",
                                                "sense_id": "3a1b0f5f-eb51-3d35-abee-30d02a08a77f",
                                                "text": "She swindled more than £200 out of me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb58ad08-0f0c-3891-aadd-4063a26be43b",
                                        "entry_id": "972d5291-c0fe-396c-b346-cfdffff50095",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "For a player in a losing position to play a clever move that provokes an error from the opponent, thus achieving a win or a draw."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "swindle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6accb02f-eb8e-3c18-8d5d-a75a6a9990f0",
                                        "entry_id": "624dffc1-24ce-314c-b239-e96c239dcf1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of swindling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3bbd577-d9bd-448f-b1b6-c85183a05946",
                                                "sense_id": "6accb02f-eb8e-3c18-8d5d-a75a6a9990f0",
                                                "text": "There were men there who had committed merciless robberies, cruel murders, heartless swindles, abominable depravities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d776c859-f35c-472f-ba86-1307eb779a8a",
                                                "sense_id": "6accb02f-eb8e-3c18-8d5d-a75a6a9990f0",
                                                "text": "[T]he scandal was the pretty common one of a corrupt agreement between hotel proprietors and a salesman who took and gave secret commissions, so that his business had a monopoly of all the drink sold in the place. It wasn't even an open slavery like an ordinary tied house; it was a swindle at the expense of everybody the manager was supposed to serve."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dac4b79e-af76-3876-9bde-e93e55cf94b0",
                                        "entry_id": "624dffc1-24ce-314c-b239-e96c239dcf1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that is deceptively not what it appears to be."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac5495ae-1f61-39ee-bf8e-7579a66fd95e",
                                        "entry_id": "624dffc1-24ce-314c-b239-e96c239dcf1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance wherein a player in a losing position plays a clever move that provokes an error from the opponent, thus achieving a win or a draw."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "984ce1cf-8b70-48e5-ae72-afa0ed1eb5fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "56dd4933-a89d-35eb-84d5-d73eb8d8d293",
